---
mm: 1.1
kind: test
name: shell-posix
use: mm.test
use: mm.shell.posix
unit: tests/mm/shell/posix/environment.cpp
unit: tests/mm/shell/posix/current_shell.cpp
unit: tests/mm/shell/posix/parse_script.cpp
unit: tests/main.cpp
option: buildable-target no
---

# mm.shell.posix test target

Covers the relocated legacy mm.shell.posix interfaces: environment accessors,
the interactive shell name, and the physical script parser.

buildable-target no because this suite uses mm.shell.posix, which is host-only.
